{"sections":[],"primaryContentSections":[{"kind":"declarations","declarations":[{"platforms":["macOS"],"languages":["swift"],"tokens":[{"text":"var","kind":"keyword"},{"text":" ","kind":"text"},{"text":"attributed","kind":"identifier"},{"text":": ","kind":"text"},{"text":"Date","kind":"typeIdentifier","preciseIdentifier":"s:20FoundationEssentials4DateV"},{"text":".","kind":"text"},{"text":"AttributedStyle","kind":"typeIdentifier","identifier":"doc:\/\/FoundationInternationalization\/documentation\/FoundationInternationalization\/FoundationEssentials\/Date\/AttributedStyle","preciseIdentifier":"s:20FoundationEssentials4DateV0A20InternationalizationE15AttributedStyleV"},{"text":" { ","kind":"text"},{"text":"get","kind":"keyword"},{"text":" }","kind":"text"}]}]},{"kind":"content","content":[{"anchor":"discussion","type":"heading","text":"Discussion","level":2},{"type":"paragraph","inlineContent":[{"type":"text","text":"Use a "},{"type":"reference","identifier":"doc:\/\/FoundationInternationalization\/documentation\/FoundationInternationalization\/FoundationEssentials\/Date\/FormatStyle","isActive":true},{"type":"text","text":" instance to customize the lexical"},{"type":"text","text":" "},{"type":"text","text":"representation of a date as a string. Use the format style’s"},{"type":"text","text":" "},{"type":"codeVoice","code":"attributed"},{"type":"text","text":" property to customize the visual representation of the"},{"type":"text","text":" "},{"type":"text","text":"date as a string. Attributed strings can represent the subcomponent"},{"type":"text","text":" "},{"type":"text","text":"characters, words, and phrases of a string with a custom combination"},{"type":"text","text":" "},{"type":"text","text":"of font size, weight, and color."}]},{"type":"paragraph","inlineContent":[{"type":"text","text":"For example, the function below uses a date format style to create a"},{"type":"text","text":" "},{"type":"text","text":"custom lexical representation of a date, then retrieves an attributed"},{"type":"text","text":" "},{"type":"text","text":"string representation of the same date and applies a visual emphasis"},{"type":"text","text":" "},{"type":"text","text":"to the year component of the date."}]},{"syntax":"swift","type":"codeListing","code":["private func makeAttributedString() -> AttributedString {","    let date = Date()","    let formatStyle = Date.FormatStyle(date: .abbreviated, time: .standard)","    var attributedString = formatStyle.attributed.format(date)","    for run in attributedString.runs {","        if let dateFieldAttribute = run.attributes.foundation.dateField,","           dateFieldAttribute == .year {","            attributedString[run.range].inlinePresentationIntent = [.emphasized, .stronglyEmphasized]","        }","    }","    return attributedString","}"]}]}],"identifier":{"interfaceLanguage":"swift","url":"doc:\/\/FoundationInternationalization\/documentation\/FoundationInternationalization\/FoundationEssentials\/Date\/FormatStyle\/attributed-swift.property"},"abstract":[{"text":"A type-erased attributed variant of this style.","type":"text"}],"deprecationSummary":[{"inlineContent":[{"type":"text","text":"Use attributedStyle instead"}],"type":"paragraph"}],"schemaVersion":{"minor":3,"major":0,"patch":0},"seeAlsoSections":[{"generated":true,"identifiers":["doc:\/\/FoundationInternationalization\/documentation\/FoundationInternationalization\/FoundationEssentials\/Date\/AttributedStyle"],"title":"Deprecated","anchor":"Deprecated"}],"variants":[{"paths":["\/documentation\/foundationinternationalization\/foundationessentials\/date\/formatstyle\/attributed-swift.property"],"traits":[{"interfaceLanguage":"swift"}]}],"hierarchy":{"paths":[["doc:\/\/FoundationInternationalization\/documentation\/FoundationInternationalization","doc:\/\/FoundationInternationalization\/documentation\/FoundationInternationalization\/FoundationEssentials","doc:\/\/FoundationInternationalization\/documentation\/FoundationInternationalizat